{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>WeekPad 是一款為 iPhone 及 iPad 設計的週計劃應用，主打如同紙本記事本的體驗：一頁顯示一週，左右滑動即可翻頁，而且完全不發送任何通知。它適合習慣以「週」為單位規劃工作與生活，又不想被提醒與數據追蹤打擾的讀者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>一週一頁滑動即翻</h2>\n<p>應用圍繞「一週一頁」設計，滑動即可逐週翻頁，全年 52 週一目瞭然。你可自由書寫純文字筆記與清單，也可拍照或掃描手寫頁、便條與單據，歸入所屬日子。工作、家庭與學業可各自使用獨立筆記本，互不混合，並支援跨筆記本搜尋與匯出。全程離線運作，無需帳號，也沒有廣告與追蹤。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-70-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-71-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-72-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-73-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-74-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-75-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：WeekPad: Weekly Planner Diary</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T05:38:54.905161+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}